## Entry Points by Task Type

### Understanding overall architecture
1. Load: `charts/structure/overview.mmd` (C4 or flowchart)
2. Also: `charts/structure/modules.mmd` (module graph)

### Tracing a feature or API flow
1. Identify the feature area from `INDEX.md`
2. Load: relevant chart from `charts/behavior/`
3. Cross-reference: `charts/structure/classes.mmd`

### Understanding data models
1. Load: `charts/data/schema.mmd`

### Finding where tech debt lives
1. Load: `charts/quality/debt.mmd` (refresh first — method=script)
2. Check: `charts/quality/complexity.mmd` for hot spots

### Reviewing project status
1. Load: `charts/project/roadmap.mmd`
2. Also: `charts/project/tasks.mmd` for current sprint

### Seeing recent development history
1. Load: `charts/quality/history.mmd` (gitGraph — refresh first)
2. Also: `charts/project/timeline.mmd`

