## Refresh Commands

Run before reading script-backed charts:
```bash
# Individual charts
python3 .flowmem/scripts/scan_ast.py > .flowmem/.cache/ast.json         # → classes.mmd
python3 .flowmem/scripts/scan_imports.py > .flowmem/.cache/imports.json  # → modules.mmd
python3 .flowmem/scripts/scan_todos.py > .flowmem/.cache/todos.json      # → debt.mmd
bash .flowmem/scripts/scan_git.sh > .flowmem/.cache/git.txt              # → history.mmd

# Full refresh
bash .flowmem/scripts/refresh_all.sh
```

