## Viewing Charts

- **VS Code**: Install [Mermaid Preview](https://marketplace.visualstudio.com/items?itemName=bierner.markdown-mermaid) extension, open any `.mmd` file
- **Online**: Paste chart content at https://mermaid.live
- **FlowSkill**: Open FlowSkill, paste chart content into the editor
- **GitHub**: Any `.mmd` in a README auto-renders on github.com

